"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"US Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent says allies need to decide if they are with the US or against it. European countries and Canada are putting pressure on Israel over its plans to expand settlements in an important part of the West Bank.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Allies Decision\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Secretario del Tesoro de EE.UU., Scott Bessent, dice que los aliados deben decidir si est\u00e1n con EE.UU. o en contra. Pa\u00edses europeos y Canad\u00e1 est\u00e1n presionando a Israel por sus planes de expandir asentamientos en una parte importante de Cisjordania.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Decisi\u00f3n de Aliados de EE.UU.\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Lebanon has handed over former General Adel Issa as Syria increases its efforts to catch wanted members of the former regime.\",            \"english_title\": \"Lebanon Hands Over General\",            \"translated_version\": \"L\u00edbano ha entregado al ex General Adel Issa mientras Siria aumenta sus esfuerzos para atrapar a miembros buscados del antiguo r\u00e9gimen.\",            \"translated_title\": \"L\u00edbano Entrega General\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Melting sea ice due to climate change has allowed giant whales to have large feeding events.\",            \"english_title\": \"Whales and Melting Ice\",            \"translated_version\": \"El hielo del mar se derrite por el cambio clim\u00e1tico y esto permite que las ballenas gigantes tengan grandes eventos de alimentaci\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ballenas y Hielo Derretido\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 17 people were killed in a big attack on Ukraine's capital overnight. The mayor, Vitali Klitschko, warns that the hot water supply has been disrupted.\",            \"english_title\": \"Attack on Ukraine's Capital\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 17 personas murieron en un gran ataque en la capital de Ucrania durante la noche. El alcalde, Vitali Klitschko, advierte que el suministro de agua caliente ha sido interrumpido.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque en Capital de Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Hui's sentencing is an important moment after Evergrande's collapse, which affected China's property sector.\",            \"english_title\": \"Hui's Sentencing\",            \"translated_version\": \"La sentencia de Hui es un momento importante despu\u00e9s del colapso de Evergrande, que afect\u00f3 al sector inmobiliario de China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Sentencia de Hui\"        }    ]}"